    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1938 the base became Sacramento Air Depot and expanded to overhaul P‑38 and P‑39 fighters.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sacramento_McClellan_Airport"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2000 the airfield transferred to Sacramento County and now operates as McClellan Business Park.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
